SUMMARY:The Fundamentals of Voiceover
DESCRIPTION:This course is designed for anyone interested in the art of voiceover\, including media professionals\, teachers\, lecturers\, and various public speakers. The course begins with a theoretical overview covering the science of sound\, language\, and the foundation of the vocal persona. Participants then transition to individual voice evaluations\, accompanied by specialized guidance on how to develop and train each voice. Participants will learn how to build a strong vocal identity and master the essential techniques and fundamentals of professional voiceover. Additionally\, the course includes practical training on performance zones using appropriate equipment that highlights vocal details in a prof
